Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,白色... 房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White... room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,座椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,卡洛·布加迪设计的王座椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlo Bugatti throne chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,钢琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,施坦威牌大三角钢琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stenway, cuts of grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,《基督诞生》 皮埃罗·德拉·弗朗西斯卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nativity, de Piero Della Francesca.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,起来走走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你说完美?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你儿子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的创造物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你来弹首曲子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you play something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我弹什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you like me to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦格纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wagner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一首?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selection?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己选吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oldest choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是众神进入英灵殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entry of the Gods into Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没有乐队伴奏 略显单薄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little anemic, not the orchestra.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你个问题吗 父亲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask you a question, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你创造了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you created me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谁创造了你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who created you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,千百年来的谜题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question of the ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,希望有一天你我能找到答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which I hope you and I will answer one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这些精美的艺术品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these wonders of art
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,设计 人类的创造力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}design, human ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个终极问题面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All utterly meaningless in the face of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,都可谓没有丝毫意义可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only question that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从何而来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do we come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不愿意相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refuse to believe that man kind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们人类不过是分子进化过程中偶然产生的副产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a random by-product of molecular circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不相信我们不过是生物学上的小概率事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more than the result of Mere biological chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一定不止如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我和你 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you and I, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来解答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那么请允许我思考片刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me then a moment to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找你的创造者 我正看着我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seek your creator. I am looking at mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我将侍奉你 但你是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will serve you. Yet you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你会死 但我不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will die. I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,给我倒杯茶 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me this tea, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,给我倒杯茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 进行能量网络充能的时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, it's time to recharge the energy grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,请迅速前往舰桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please report to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这就来 老妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my way, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,目前正在展开充能帆板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploying energy recharge cells now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.69,0:07:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,帆板已就位 现在开始充能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cells deployed. Recharge commencing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,七声钟响 一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven bells and all's well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,船员检查完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crew checks complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,使用新安全代码 31564-F\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New security Code 31564-F
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚在106扇区检测到一次中微子爆发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A neutrino burst was detected in sector 106.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能会引发灾难性后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could trigger a destructive event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,请你立刻前往舰桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report to the bridge immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这就来 老妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my way, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 检测到能量骤增\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, power surge detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.07,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 快收起充能帆板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, retract the energy cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,启用所有备用能源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And channel all useless power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,紧急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,威胁等级 危急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Threat level: CRITICAL.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.61,0:09:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,启动紧急船员唤醒程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate emergency crew revival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.23,0:09:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所有非必要人员 请迅速离开冬眠舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Non-essential personnel, evacuate the cryo chamber immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝 看着我 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniels! Look at me, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.59,0:09:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你要马上起来 好吗 我们要提前出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to get up. Ok? We're coming up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,改写紧急安全协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Override the SSP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,呼唤现在就打开冬眠舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And breach the chamber now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 快起来 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, come on up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布 快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 雅各布 - 别妨碍他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jake. - Let them work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布 我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake! Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 丹妮尔斯 快走 - 雅各布 快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Daniels, come on! - Jake! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让他们来 - 雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let them work. - Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.11,0:10:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们来 让他们来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them work! Let them work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它打开 - 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get it open! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布 雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake! Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把她送到后边去 让她走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her out of there! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你在哪 我想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Where are you? I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 我说过要和你一起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I know. I said I wouldn't go without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 没 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you alright? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是快点上来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get your ass up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不能保证救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't make any promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是你的船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're your crew now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要领导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信我 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You believe in dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我来迟了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I'm late, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要紧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道该怎么表达 所以我就直说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think of any other way to say it even... to say are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遭受了惨痛的悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We suffered a... A monumental tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,以后我会尽我所能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm gonna do the best that I can to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,来接下雅各布的担子 以他为榜样 做好这个舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}live up to Jacob, his, fine example as your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将永远永远缅怀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he, he will be sorely missed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我提前感谢大家的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm grateful in advance for your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们损失了47名殖民者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we lost 47 colonists
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还有16个二代胚胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and 16 second generation embryos
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,以及一名大家都认识的船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, one, obviously one crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,另外目前飞船船体的完整性稳定在83%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The current structural integrity of the ship is holding at 83%
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们有很多次级系统都处于离线状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we have many secondary systems that are offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,附近的恒星耀斑引起了高能冲击波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A highly charge shock wave from nearby stellar ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当时展开了能量帆充能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the cells were deploying for recharge
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,吸收了巨量冲击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we absorbed the full burn of the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Walter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你和老妈对核心代码进行彻彻底底的检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will want you and mother time to go a complete
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,彻底检查以帮助我们找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}core code review so that we can understand
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这场事故发生的根源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how's those happened in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个局部随机事件 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a random localized event, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法检测到自然发生的恒星耀斑 也无法预警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way to detect spontaneous stellar flares until it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们运气差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 法里斯 我不相信运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Faris, I don't believe in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我对运气没兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not interested in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我更希望我们可以更能干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer that we be more capable
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,准备更足 不靠运气 而是靠观察 思考 信仰和决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and prepared than lucky. Observation, reflection, faith and determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们才有可能探明前方那条漫长未知的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this way we may navigate the path as it unfolds before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗 我们是还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright? We have what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,大概八个充电周期的路才能到达欧瑞伽6号吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight more recharge cycles to go before we get to Origae-6?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在问我吗 长官? - 是的 沃尔特 我在问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that a question, sir? - Yes, Walter, that's a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:14:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们先把飞船修好 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...let's get this ship fixed.. Ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.89,0:15:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们就开工吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's uh, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了47名殖民者 以及我们的舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just lost 47 colonists and our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要进行哀悼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to acknowledge that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.91,0:15:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很明白你的心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果不及时修好船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we don't make these repairs
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就会失去所有殖民者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will lose all the colonists.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但我们应该为巴拉森舰长做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we should do something for Captain Branson at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.85,0:15:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事情没有商量 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a discussion. Tennessee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,整地模块已经稳定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The terraforming module is stable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但连接支架受了点损伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the connecting struts took some damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我还得去检查车辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still need to check the vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你愿意的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.06,0:15:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 你预计需要多久才能再次进行速航?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, How long do you predict before we can make our next jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,完成修理大概需要48小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repairs should take approximately 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:16:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们应该尽快撤出这个区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we should make an effort to vacate the sector
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,以防后续耀斑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in case of after flares.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们开工吧 解散吧 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's get to work ok? Dismissed. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,C62号门已开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C-62 open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭C62号 打开17号空气阀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal C-62. Open Airlock 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,打开整地舱舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open door to terraforming bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,张力下降了15%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tensions are 15% down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,拉紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,收到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布梦想着我们在新世界造一间小木屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake have this dream of us building a cabin on the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,做两个拓荒者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like pioneers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,木屋建在湖畔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cabin on a lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,欧瑞伽6号的殖民区域内刚好有个湖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a lake in the terraforming zone on Origae-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是真正的木头做的木屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean a real cabin made of real wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以飞船上载了建造木屋要用的木料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So in the ship storage, there's enough wood to build a cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还有斧子 锯子和金属钉子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Axes and saws and metal nails
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这些东西我完全都不会用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a clue what to do with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为了开始新生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to start our new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看来这是何苦呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I wonder, why bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你们说过要在湖边建一间木屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you promised to build a log cabin on a lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他最爱这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was his favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是个有品位的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不加冰 不加水 不加淡酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No ice, no water, no chaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,都不加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,入乡随俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When in Rome
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,敬那些英年早逝的好人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To all the good people gone to soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,永远铭记他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May we remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,永远铭记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们公然违抗我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They disobeyed a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她只是安葬了她丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She buried her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不 凯瑞 不是那样的 他们不信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Karine, it's not that. They don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们不信任我的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they don't trust me for the same reason
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,与公司不让我负责这次任务的理由一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the company didn't trust me to lead this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们认为我有宗教信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you can't be a person of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就肯定没办法做出正确的 理智的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And be counted on to make qualified rational decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得我是个极端份子 说白了 就是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an extremist. You know, you're a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.71,0:19:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们到达目的地以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we get to where we're going
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人就不再是你的手下了 而是你的邻居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This people won't be your crew anymore. They will be your neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,可别忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对他们友善点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tread softly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.51,0:20:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,法里斯 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,老天呐 你们看看这景色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, y'all should see this view.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你修好摄像机阵列之前 我们什么也看不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't see anything until you get the camera ring fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会从窗户里往外看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you look out the damn window, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,安哥 快点 我们赶紧恢复电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ankor, come on, let's get this power back up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这样他们就可以欣赏这美景了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so these people can enjoy the beautiful view.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 安哥 就位之后通知我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Ankor, let me know when you're in a position.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们就开始干活吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就位了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,断开缆绳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都顺利吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All good, Tee?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很顺利 搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, we are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,收起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reel her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.49,0:21:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,正在启动绞盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winch engaging, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,帆板收起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reeling her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太顺利了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.09,0:21:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,摄像系统恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we are back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done Tee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们连上系统了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're alive down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.21,0:21:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,回来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.51,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可别丢下我跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave without me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们丢下他走人 怎么样 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to leave without him, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 丹妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.81,0:22:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我这边收工了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, that's me done, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我跟着你回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I'm following you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦给辛苦异常的我准备好冰镇啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please have a cold beer ready for the weary traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题亲爱的 我跟你一起喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it, darling. I will draw circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 你把那个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, Faris? Put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们刚才 看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the.. Did you guys just see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.62,0:22:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 你能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.24,0:22:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee, can you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee. You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 回去了 我这就回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Coming in. I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很有可能是外星信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rogue transmission loss, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的头盔能收到 是因为你漂得太远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your helmet must have picked it up because you were so far out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.35,0:23:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,超出了通讯缓冲器范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Past our communication buffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.90,0:23:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还有音频吗 老妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there audio, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.35,0:23:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,正在整理 请稍候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collating. A moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经重整了这段信号 奥姆舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reoriented the transmission, Captain Oram.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是回波 我们的仪器受损不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta be an echo, instruments took a lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.41,0:23:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到这后 它每隔46秒出现一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been happening every 46 seconds ever since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是约翰·丹佛的歌吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fucking John Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.00,0:23:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是"乡村路带我回家"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's "Take Me Home, Country Roads".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.49,0:23:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kiddin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不 我从来不拿丹佛开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I never kid about John Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.11,0:24:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,信号里还有定位数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is geometric data too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 请查一下信号的发射源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, please track the signal to its source.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,正在查找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,信号源已经成功定位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Source of transmission located.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.29,0:24:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,发现该信号来自87号扇区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signal originates in the sector 87.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.48,0:24:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,具体位置赤经47.6度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right ascension 47.6
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是位于我们当前位置下方24.3度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a declination of 24.3 from our current location.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.35,0:24:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是一颗主序恒星 就像我们的太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She appears to be a main sequence star lot like our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.85,0:24:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比太阳更古老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But old, very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.87,0:24:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有五颗行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.01,0:24:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.07,0:24:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,第四颗行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Planet number four.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.83,0:24:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,第四颗行星正处在宜居带上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The planet number four is square in a habitable zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.43,0:24:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很符合我们的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime candidate, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:25:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,行星地表重力是0.96G 有海洋和陆地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}0.96 G's at surface, oceans, land mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.27,0:25:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,非常有可能存在生态圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High likely hood of a living biosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.30,0:25:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,比我们对欧瑞伽6号最乐观的预测还要好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's beyond the most optimistic projections of Oriage-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.41,0:25:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,之前怎么没发现 整个扇区都扫描过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did we miss this? We scanned the entire sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.69,0:25:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,里克斯 离我们多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricks, how far is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,非常近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.83,0:25:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,启动速航 几周就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little jump. A few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们甚至不需要回去冬眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't even have to go back into hyper sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.12,0:25:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们去欧瑞伽6号需要多久呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how long is it gonna take to get to Origae-6?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,需要7年4个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven years, four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.93,0:25:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话我们可是要睡很久啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one hell of a sleep cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.83,0:25:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我相信这里没人愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I think it's safe to say that none of us are too keen
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.57,0:25:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,再回到冬眠舱里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on getting back to one of those pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.30,0:25:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该近距离观察一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we need to, um... Take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.60,0:25:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有人反对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.15,0:25:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那好 里克斯 我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Ricks, let's..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.02,0:25:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们改变航线 近距离观察一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try to course and take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.17,0:25:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.78,0:26:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 能聊几句吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.40,0:26:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定要这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.52,0:26:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们花了十年寻找欧瑞伽6号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've spent a decade searching for Origae-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,做过调查 做过模拟试验 绘制过地形图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We vetted it, we ran the simulations, we mapped the terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们为它接受训练 - 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's what we trained for. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.92,0:26:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在要抛开这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we're gonna scrap all that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.49,0:26:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去追踪一个外星信号吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to chase a rogue transmission?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.82,0:26:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在不可能有人类的星球上 出现一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A human being out there where there can't be any humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一个隐藏的星球莫名其妙地出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hidden planet that turns up out of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.84,0:26:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还碰巧符合我们所有的要求 哪有这么好的事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just happens to be perfect for us. It's too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.02,0:26:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有这么好的事 你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too good to be true? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.28,0:26:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说谁知道那有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know what the fuck's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.84,0:26:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,或许只是以前没发现它 丹妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we just missed the planet, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.17,0:26:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可这个风险实在是太大了 根本就不值得去冒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a monumental risk not worth taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.09,0:26:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有定死走哪条路啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not committing to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.65,0:26:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想根据具体情况随机应变做出选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm simply trying to navigate the path as it unfolds before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.77,0:26:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这颗星球很有潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this has the potential
