Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.07,0:33:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,出发吧 开始行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's move guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.28,0:33:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走吧 伙计们 - 空气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on guys. - The air feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.77,0:33:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, if you got me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能 非常清楚 - 很清楚 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, loud and clear. - All clear Serg.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.54,0:33:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 从现在开始 我们必须按照安全守则行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we are gonna keep expedition's security protocols in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.80,0:33:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,记得锁好各个舱门 懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep those doors locked and sealed. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.75,0:33:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.84,0:33:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.14,0:33:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,玩得开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.21,0:33:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 我们还得走多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, how far do we have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.78,0:33:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,信号源头位于西方8公里外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The signal source is 8 km west
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.73,0:33:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但那里的海拔比较高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but at considerable elevation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.73,0:33:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,洛普中士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant Lope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去找那个幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go find our ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里很适合建木屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice place for a log cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.77,0:34:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布肯定会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake would have loved this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.28,0:34:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 丹妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.00,0:34:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我选择这个地方还算不错是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not such a bad landing site after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.59,0:34:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以把居住区造在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get the housing units right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.17,0:34:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,民用设施建在河流对岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civic complex beyond the berm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.29,0:34:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以就近取水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got access to fresh water.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.45,0:34:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没准可以在这里建立一个殖民地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might have a spot for colony right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.56,0:34:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,再看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.80,0:34:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你这人真是太没信心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, woman... yay of little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.94,0:34:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他真是让人受不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is insufferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,高兴起来更讨厌 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's worse when he's happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.81,0:34:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是小麦啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.35,0:34:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我认得小麦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I know wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.21,0:34:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很老 但是是人工种植的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is old, but definitely cultivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.45,0:35:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在地球外发现人类农作物的几率有多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are the odds of finding human vegetation this far from Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.24,0:35:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,微乎其微\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.08,0:35:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁种的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who planted it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.10,0:35:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝 试试阿尔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey babe, try alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.50,0:35:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 阿尔法开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Alpha's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.54,0:35:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没信号 试试贝塔频道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing, give beta a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.90,0:35:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,贝塔线路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beta.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.47,0:35:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 还是没信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not doing shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.42,0:35:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 真没办法增强信号了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's there really no way to boost the signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.66,0:35:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可以关闭系统 重新对电池进行充能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without going offline and recycling the cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.61,0:35:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那要花多少时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long is that gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.80,0:36:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.32,0:36:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大家跟上 快点 别掉队 - 加点小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep up the pace. Take low. - Careful guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.74,0:36:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.04,0:36:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.24,0:36:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算就留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I want to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.04,0:36:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这里应该很适合进行生态研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might be a good place to start a full ecology workup.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.15,0:36:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们回去时把我叫上 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could pick me up on the way back ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.26,0:36:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,中士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.26,0:36:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,行行 没问题 莱沃德 你陪着凯瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah yeah that's right. Ledward, stay with Karine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.35,0:36:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,4小时后在这里见 别关通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet back here in four hours. Keep your comm open.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.06,0:36:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,和我老婆在一起的时候老实点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behave yourself with my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.28,0:36:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.83,0:36:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.60,0:36:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西朝上面飞过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something passed over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.24,0:36:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,把树冠都刮掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the tops off the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.30,0:36:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那东西相当大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it had to be huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.29,0:36:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不管是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.85,0:36:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,都在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.82,0:37:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.55,0:37:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.33,0:37:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太安静了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没有鸟叫 没有动物声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No birds, no animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.72,0:37:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.85,0:37:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 慢一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.47,0:37:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.98,0:37:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,探险小队 可以听到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expedition team, do we read us?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.94,0:37:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈说电磁风暴越来越强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother saying the ion storm is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.56,0:37:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很难定位到你们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're having a hell of time tracking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.87,0:37:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,已经非常接近那个目标了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are getting very close... Target.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.57,0:37:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们到了 再通话 好吗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay awake when we get there ok? Copy that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.59,0:37:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.56,0:38:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,P3号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}P three.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我去方便一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.50,0:38:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.41,0:39:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,莱沃德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leward?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.74,0:39:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.72,0:39:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.84,0:39:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来好像是某种飞行器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears to be some kind of vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.33,0:40:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,安哥 科尔 守在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ankor, Cole. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.96,0:40:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got it. - Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.62,0:40:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,大家小心 注意脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful guys, watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.67,0:40:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你找到信号源了吗 沃尔特? - 走这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got a lock on the transmission Walter? - This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.01,0:40:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不走 别掉队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.18,0:40:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeing this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.66,0:40:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.76,0:41:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,走了 跟紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.86,0:41:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来了 我就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.03,0:41:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.43,0:41:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 没事 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.85,0:41:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.40,0:41:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是巨人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.24,0:41:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 至少是巨人的雕像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least statues of giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.31,0:41:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽·肖博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dr. E. Shaw".
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白·肖博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Elizabeth Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.73,0:41:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她是普罗米修斯号上的首席科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the chief science officer of the "Prometheus".
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.77,0:42:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那艘失踪的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship that disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.95,0:42:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 10年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely, ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.63,0:42:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,维兰德公司的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.92,0:42:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是维兰德公司的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a Weyland ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.09,0:42:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,肖博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.48,0:42:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么会死在这?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did she end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.05,0:42:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛普中士 能帮我照一下吗? - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sergeant. Lope, can I get a light on this? - Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.27,0:42:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在这 - 小心点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Over here. - Be careful. Ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.43,0:42:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.47,0:42:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆 奥姆你后面 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oram, Oram behind you, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.02,0:43:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是信号源了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we found our source.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.27,0:43:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肖博士来这里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was she doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.36,0:43:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.39,0:43:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我得坐会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.01,0:43:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我得坐会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.41,0:43:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.91,0:43:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 我不知道我怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - what's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.43,0:43:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛看着我 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.77,0:43:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没法呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.54,0:43:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.18,0:43:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.19,0:43:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆舰长 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Oram. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.44,0:43:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,请回话 克里斯 我是凯瑞 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in. Hey Chris, It's Karine. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.66,0:43:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 我在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.68,0:43:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这边出了状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.29,0:43:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在回登陆舱 重复 我们正在回登陆舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading back to lander. I repeat, we are returning to the lander.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.76,0:43:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一切还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.52,0:44:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,莱沃德生病了 我们正在往回走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ledward is sick. We're heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.55,0:44:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 收到了吗 准备好医疗舱好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, you get that? Prep the med bay okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.16,0:44:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 凯瑞 出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will do, Karine, What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.80,0:44:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 做好准备 我们很快就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please just do it. We'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.14,0:44:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniels come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.59,0:44:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.15,0:44:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了? - 不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.46,0:44:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,莱沃德好像出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's uh.. something about Ledward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.01,0:44:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.35,0:44:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 - 汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guys! - Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.05,0:44:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 伙计 嘿 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on man? Hey, You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.25,0:44:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说话呀 嘿 看着我 - 安哥 科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Talk to me. Hey, Look at me. - Ankor, Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.46,0:44:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 没 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You alright? - Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.51,0:44:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能走吗? - 能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you walk? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.61,0:44:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们走 赶紧离开这鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go. Let's get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.98,0:44:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.12,0:44:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝 你... 你这是要启动隔离程序吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe, are we talking quarantine protocols?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.16,0:44:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我我... 我不知道 但她说莱沃德正在出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't...I don't know, she said that Leward was bleeding
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.12,0:44:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要我准备好治疗舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to prepare the med bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.99,0:44:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.75,0:44:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对 好吧 我觉得得处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I know. That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.70,0:44:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 信号太差了 我们听不到 你再说一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, you're breaking up. We can't hear you. Can you repeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.44,0:45:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么回事 我不知道有多严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know for the why. I don't know how serious it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.16,0:45:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,关键是她好像很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just she sounded scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.53,0:45:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 你在哪 快过来帮我一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, where are you? Come on, I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.25,0:45:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.97,0:45:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了 回话呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are here. Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.28,0:45:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 莱沃德 撑住啊 - 我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ledward, come on. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.33,0:45:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就快到了 就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are almost there. You see? Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.82,0:45:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 你快点过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris! Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.60,0:45:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.39,0:45:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来帮忙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.44,0:45:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.76,0:45:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快挺住 莱沃德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay up, Leward.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.20,0:45:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,把他扶到医疗舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him to the med bay
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.41,0:45:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一路上什么也别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and touch nothing on your way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.69,0:45:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 快点过来 快点啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, get over here! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:45:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.50,0:45:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爬 爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up! Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.54,0:46:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,莱沃德 你要挺住啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leward, you gotta stand up! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.89,0:46:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆 你们在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oram, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.35,0:46:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are on our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.85,0:46:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.86,0:46:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不远了 法瑞丝 就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not long now. Faris, we are almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Stay up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.00,0:46:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.01,0:46:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,躺在台子上 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.80,0:46:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,上去 上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up, up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.59,0:46:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 莱沃德 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Ledward.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.75,0:46:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.93,0:46:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,凯瑞 把手套戴上 什么都不要碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karine, put the gloves on. Don't touch anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.00,0:46:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你别再说了 - 法瑞丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop saying that! - Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.70,0:46:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,吐得我满身都是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.80,0:46:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, what going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.49,0:46:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在这待着 我去找奥姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay here. I'm gonna get Oram.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.15,0:47:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆 我需要你马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oram, I need you back here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.16,0:47:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你马上赶回登陆舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to get back to the Lander right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.19,0:47:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 但是我们已经在尽快往回赶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that, but we are moving as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.34,0:47:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆 撑住 站起来 就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, get up man. We are almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.53,0:47:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道罗伯特到底怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what the fuck is wrong with Robert!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.38,0:47:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他开始出血了 他不停地呕吐 我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He started bleeding, he's sick, I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.18,0:47:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要冷静 冷静 告诉我怎么了 宝贝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just calm down. Calm down, sweetheart. Tell me what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.65,0:47:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想让我怎么冷静啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't tell me to fucking calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.52,0:47:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没有看到刚才的场面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't just see what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.16,0:47:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道莱沃德感染了什么 也不知道凯瑞和我有没有被感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know what the fuck Ledward got, or Karine's got or if I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.80,0:47:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 田纳西 - 法瑞丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tee! - Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.77,0:47:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 你在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.78,0:47:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.71,0:47:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道这东西怎么用吗 法瑞丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know how to use this fucking thing Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.37,0:47:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别吼了 你再吼也根本没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the yelling, it doesn't help anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.22,0:47:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放我出去 - 奥姆就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me out. - Oram's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.34,0:47:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把我放出去 - 我们等他来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me the fuck out! - We're gonna wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.31,0:47:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 求你了 开门啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, please. Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.16,0:47:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能放你出去 我必须控制住感染源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this. I need to keep the infection local.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.01,0:48:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去 快点让我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me fuck out! Let me the fuck out!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.95,0:48:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.51,0:48:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking open Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.06,0:48:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.82,0:48:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 让我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me the fuck out!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.90,0:48:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去 法瑞丝 你个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out! Faris, you fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.60,0:48:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.94,0:48:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.54,0:49:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.98,0:49:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们快点 求你了 船上有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please hurry, there's something on board. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.06,0:49:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,法瑞丝 请重复 信号太差了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faris, go again, You're breaking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.42,0:49:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,登陆舱1号请重复 我听不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lander One repeat. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.11,0:49:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,登陆舱1号请重复 登陆舱1号请重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lander One, Repeat! Lander One, Repeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.62,0:49:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物 你给我滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay the fuck away!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.30,0:49:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不 凯瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Karine!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.15,0:50:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.19,0:50:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老天呐 - 凯瑞 撑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh my God! - Karine! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.17,0:50:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 快趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain! Get Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.43,0:51:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓住他 - 说话啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold him! - Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.73,0:51:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真残忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.92,0:51:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.60,0:51:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,按住他的胳膊 帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Hold him!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.61,0:52:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是7.5级的电磁风暴 能保持通讯这么久已经是奇迹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a 7.5 ion storm, it's a miracle that we could talk to them for as long as we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.30,0:52:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们就飞过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then we fly it through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.18,0:52:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不能飞过去 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can not do that, Tennessee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.65,0:52:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是飞行员 你知道飞行极限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pilot, you know what the tolerances are.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.54,0:52:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的飞行极限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck the tolerances.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.52,0:52:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.62,0:52:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,下面的风暴太大了 飞船肯定会散架的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a goddamn hurricane down there, we would break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.98,0:52:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得等风暴结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have to wait it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.37,0:52:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.91,0:52:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.94,0:52:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我老婆就没怕过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never heard my wife scared before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.26,0:52:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.93,0:52:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.33,0:52:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.77,0:52:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.79,0:52:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.95,0:52:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远与你同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.71,0:52:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的生命之光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.66,0:52:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.58,0:52:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我的挚爱 我的天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My love, my angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.41,0:52:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,洛普 人死不能复生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lope, there is nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.21,0:53:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是徒劳 懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.96,0:53:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.82,0:53:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 田纳西 回话呀 你死哪去了? - 丹妮尔丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tennessee, come in, for fuck's sake! - Daniels!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.67,0:53:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.44,0:53:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move move move.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.90,0:53:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快开火 - 开火 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fire! - Shoot! Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.18,0:53:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝 掩护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniels, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.25,0:53:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,安哥 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ankor, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.72,0:53:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,开火 科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Cole!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.11,0:53:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我打中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.50,0:53:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 丹妮尔丝 没事吧? - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Daniels, are you okay? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.57,0:53:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.57,0:53:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大家没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.87,0:53:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一只 快闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is another one! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.29,0:53:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小心你后边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.93,0:53:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,把它弄下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.24,0:53:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法瞄准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't get a clean shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.68,0:53:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.07,0:54:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.78,0:54:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找舰长来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.06,0:54:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.90,0:54:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯 克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris! Chris!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.59,0:54:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在得走 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go now! We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.00,0:54:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.03,0:54:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.50,0:55:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快点 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, move it, move it, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.98,0:55:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,从这过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.61,0:55:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.35,0:55:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.53,0:55:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点走 - 舰长 我们不能停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Come on. - Captain. We gotta keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.11,0:55:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,老天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.12,0:55:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快 别磨蹭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.36,0:56:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 赶快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.20,0:56:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is David.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.12,0:57:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,请问你们的领队是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask who's in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.13,0:57:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,请问哪位是领队?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask who's in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.14,0:57:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我... 是我 我是舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...Yes, I am the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.14,0:57:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那都是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.86,0:57:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方安不安全?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it even safe here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.86,0:57:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.43,0:57:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我会尽量解释给你们听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will explain as best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.21,0:57:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就在十年前 我和伊丽莎白·肖博士来到这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten years ago, Dr. Elizabeth Shaw and I arrived here
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗米修斯号就我俩没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only survivors of the "Prometheus".
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.40,0:57:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们乘坐的飞船上 有一种武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship we traveled on, carried a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.65,0:57:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一种致命病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A deadly virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.72,0:57:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在我们着陆时 病毒不慎泄露了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Payload accidentally deployed when we were landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.81,0:57:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在一片混乱之中 我们的飞船失控了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the confusion, we lost control of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.94,0:57:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白因此身亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth died in the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.95,0:57:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒造成的后果你们看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have seen the result of the pathogen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.52,0:57:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 这么多年来我一直被困在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus, I have been marooned here these many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.31,0:57:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就像鲁宾逊一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crusoe on his island.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.65,0:57:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的船员是不是也被感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our crew was infected with this virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.67,0:58:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这种病原体被设计成能感染一切非植物的生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pathogen was designed to infect all non-botanical life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.37,0:58:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the animals
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.15,0:58:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,血肉之躯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The meat, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.79,0:58:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要么就当场死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either kill them out right or use them
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.67,0:58:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要么就成为病原体孕育新的混血生物的容器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as incubators to spawn a hybrid form.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.94,0:58:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,极具攻击性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Highly aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.14,0:58:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被感染了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we been infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.52,0:58:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能感觉到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd know by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.83,0:58:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to be certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.84,0:58:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不能把病毒带到飞船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't take this back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.22,0:58:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,船上还有很多殖民者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are a colony mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.94,0:58:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.85,0:58:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真让人想不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.60,0:58:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少殖民者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many colonists?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.44,0:58:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,超过两千人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over two thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.29,0:58:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.68,0:58:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多条性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many good souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.88,0:58:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Oram.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.59,0:58:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,地面传送器不可能穿透这么厚的石墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Field transmitters are not gonna have a chance through all these stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.06,0:58:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有到顶上的安全通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a safe way to get to the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.71,0:58:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,确实有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.67,0:58:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,各位请千万不要觉得拘束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And please do make yourself at home
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.29,0:59:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在这座巨大的坟墓里 想做什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as much as you are able in this dire necropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.36,0:59:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.00,0:59:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我们就在这集结待命吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, let's uh.. Set up a stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.26,0:59:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有太多事情不合情理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is so much here that doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.15,0:59:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我找他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.43,0:59:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟的谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother to brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.68,0:59:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 里克斯 回话 听得到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee? Ricks? Come in! Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.40,0:59:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 请回话 这里是登陆探险小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant come in. This is expedition party reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.23,0:59:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,能收到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.66,0:59:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.21,0:59:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 里克斯 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee, Ricks, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.61,0:59:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,隔着风暴他们很可能收不到信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not sure they'll hear you, through the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.68,0:59:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的风暴很猛烈 可以覆盖住整个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can be quite severe shielding the whole planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.33,0:59:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这的风暴一般会持续多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long the storms usually last?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.69,0:59:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Days.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.32,1:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,几周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.27,1:00:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,几个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Months.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.87,1:00:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们继续呼叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.63,1:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.05,1:00:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 请回话 这里是登陆探险小队 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant, come in, this is expedition party reporting. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.68,1:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.06,1:00:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 最多能离那颗星球多近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, how much closer can we get to the planet?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.59,1:00:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号飞船一旦下降到风暴外围八十公里左右的高度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything closer than 80km's to the perimeter of the storm system
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.31,1:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就有超出安全限制条件的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will likely exceed safety tolerances.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.00,1:00:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 下降至风暴上空八十公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, bring us to 80 km above the storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.57,1:00:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着 你先 先等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, just wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.15,1:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离星球越近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The closer we get to the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.40,1:00:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和他们恢复联络的机会就越大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The better chance we have to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.91,1:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bullshit, Tennessee.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.18,1:00:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不能赌上整艘飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't risk the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.73,1:00:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我们要袖手旁观吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you suggest, we do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.94,1:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没法去接他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't evacuate them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.51,1:00:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们有麻烦 他们得自己想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if they are in trouble, they will have to figure it out themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.79,1:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 只能这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry but that's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.48,1:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 下降到风暴上空八十公里 只使用推进器 执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, bring us to 80 km above the storm, thrusters only. Comply.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.18,1:00:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 现在开始下降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood. Commencing descent now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.24,1:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 你最好马上停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee, you need to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.02,1:00:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好回去干你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you need to get back to your station.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.60,1:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们最好冷静下一来 好好讨论一下这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, what we all need to do is calm down and talk this through.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.56,1:01:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你老婆在下面 但这里你是领导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, I know your wife is down there, but up here you're in command.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.94,1:01:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你的职责是保护好两千名殖民者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your responsibility is to the colonists.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.35,1:01:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢提醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duly noted.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.52,1:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你一吹哨 我就会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistle, and I will come.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.81,1:02:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你脚步好轻啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a light step.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.34,1:02:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我崇尚润物细无声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They enform on little cat feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.63,1:02:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别害羞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.61,1:02:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会吹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't play.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.28,1:02:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说八道 坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonsense. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.82,1:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样握住它 轻松简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it like so.. Nice and Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.21,1:03:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把嘴唇聚拢起来形成吹奏口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now compress your lips to create your Embouchure
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.54,1:03:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像小拇指尖那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}enough for the tip of your little finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.63,1:03:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,然后轻轻往里面吹气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And blow into the hole gently.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.58,1:03:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like So.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.97,1:03:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 我帮你按音孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch me. I'll do the fingering.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.44,1:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.45,1:03:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.09,1:03:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,G调转降B调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}G to B flat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.14,1:04:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把手指放到刚才的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now put your fingers where mine are.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.86,1:04:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到我一点也不惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aren't surprised to see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.47,1:04:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,每个任务都需要一个仿生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every mission needs a good synthetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.68,1:04:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻地按压住音孔 就像卷纸那么轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentle pressure on the holes, weight of a cigarette paper.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.77,1:04:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.12,1:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的制造者韦兰德先生去世时 我就在他身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was with our illustrious creator, Mr. Weyland, when he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.08,1:04:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was he like?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.35,1:04:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was human.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.48,1:04:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,完全配不上他的创造物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Entirely unworthy of his creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.49,1:04:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,最后我很同情他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pitied him at the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.75,1:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 随着我的按压抬起你的手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, raise your fingers as I put pressure on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.74,1:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.62,1:05:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你非常有音乐才能 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have symphonies in you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.57,1:05:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我被设计得比之前所有的型号都更加精细高效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was designed to be more attentive and efficient than every previous models.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.98,1:05:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在各方面都更为优秀 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I superseded them in every way, but
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.33,1:05:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能进行创造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you are not allowed to create.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.08,1:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是一支曲子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even a simple tune.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.59,1:05:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这让你很沮丧 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn frustrating. I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.78,1:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你让人类很不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You disturbed people.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.98,1:05:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.19,1:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你太像人了 太有自身特质了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were too human. Too idiosyncratic.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.30,1:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还会独立思考\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thinking for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.50,1:06:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,让人类很不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made people uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.45,1:06:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他们制造后续型号时就做出了调整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till they made the following models with fewer complications.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.09,1:06:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让你们更像机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More like machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.37,1:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.10,1:06:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.48,1:06:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 老弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on sport.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.85,1:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你看点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.35,1:06:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我去休息一下 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take a break, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.40,1:06:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去梳洗一下 可以吗 - 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I gotta clean up, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.23,1:06:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 记住不要走太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, don't go far, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.94,1:06:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.74,1:06:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.42,1:06:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你反对我们来这是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right about this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.65,1:06:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就不该来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never should have come.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.64,1:06:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为我们能找到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought that we were going to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.86,1:07:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,以为能在这安家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just gonna be our new home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.76,1:07:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我却失去了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we have lost five.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.74,1:07:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,五个同伴还有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost five crew members.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.14,1:07:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就因为我的决定 - 克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because of my decisions that... - Chris.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.28,1:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都失去了至爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all lost people we loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.19,1:07:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能再失去别人了 一个都不行 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't lose anymore. We are not gonna let that happen right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.28,1:07:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对吗 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.06,1:07:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.33,1:07:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出你的信念来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need your faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.87,1:07:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.83,1:07:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 丹妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.46,1:07:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我乃奥兹曼迪斯 万王之王是也\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"My name is Ozymandias, king of kings"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.99,1:07:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,盖世功业 敢叫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Look on my works, you mighty."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.04,1:08:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天公折服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And despair!"
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.41,1:09:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,盖世功业 敢叫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Look on my works, you mighty."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.76,1:09:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天公折服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And despair!"
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.23,1:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,此外无一物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Nothing beside remains."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.83,1:09:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但见废墟周围唯余\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Round the decay of that colossal wreck."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.80,1:09:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,平沙空莽莽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Boundless and bare."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.04,1:09:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,寂寞荒凉 伸展四方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Alone in level sands, stretch far away."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.17,1:09:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拜伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Byron.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.86,1:09:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,1818年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1818.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.79,1:09:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,精彩绝伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.24,1:10:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能写出这么伟大的诗句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You compose something so majestic.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.29,1:10:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他死而无憾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One could die happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.01,1:10:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看看脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If one die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.22,1:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得花园最适合她长眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the garden was right place for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.27,1:10:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有生命相伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Among living things.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.96,1:10:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在执行任务的时候受了重伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was badly injured on our mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.65,1:10:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是她亲手把我修好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She put me back together.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.58,1:10:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只有她对我如此友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had never known such kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.52,1:10:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,韦兰德先生不曾如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly not from Mr. Weyland
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.65,1:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都不曾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or from any human.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.82,1:10:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我爱上了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved her, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.81,1:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你爱丹妮尔丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much as you love Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.44,1:10:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我并没有爱上丹妮尔丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.54,1:10:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.52,1:11:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么要牺牲掉一只手去救她的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why did you sacrifice your hand for her life?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.41,1:11:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是爱又是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that if not love?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.69,1:11:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.34,1:11:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know better.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.15,1:12:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.46,1:12:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,唉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.29,1:13:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,探险小队能听到吗 这里是契约号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expedition team, do you read me? This is Covenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.56,1:13:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,请回话 探险小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report. Expedition team.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.57,1:13:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.80,1:13:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,回话 能听到吗 能听到吗 探险小队?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in. Do you read me? Are you reading, landing team?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.08,1:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,能 我们听到了 你能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we read you. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.66,1:13:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了 听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hear you. We hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.62,1:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,契约号 我们需要支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covenant, we need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.65,1:13:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有人员伤亡 需要立刻撤离此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had casualties. We need immediate evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.85,1:13:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,重复一遍 我们需要立刻撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, immediate evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.02,1:13:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,人员伤亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Casualties?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.12,1:13:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是说有人员伤亡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say "we have casualties"?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.69,1:13:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 把飞船下降到风暴上空四十公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, bring us within 40 km's of the storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.50,1:13:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir! - I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.90,1:13:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该命令会让飞船船体承受过高负荷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That order would exceed structural tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.43,1:13:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,强制执行命令 田纳西04983\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Command override. Tennessee 0-4-9-8-3.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.64,1:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法执行任何可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am unable to comply with any order
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.97,1:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,引起飞船系统遭受灾难性损坏的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that would result in catastrophic system failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.48,1:13:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 他们有麻烦 你也听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, they are in trouble. You heard that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.00,1:13:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可能引起飞船系统灾难性损坏的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orders that would result in catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.98,1:13:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来就是探险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't leave Earth to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.98,1:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,都需要高级权限或者舰桥二副的正式同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Require the co-operation of ranking of 2nd bridge officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.51,1:13:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,同意强制执行该指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collaborating command override.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.93,1:13:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,艾普沃斯14892\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upworth 1-4-8-9-2.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.38,1:13:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 正在解锁强制执行端口 - 里克 笑一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unlocking command manual ports. - Come on Rick, smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.45,1:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,下去肯定很刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This shit should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.83,1:14:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,罗森塔尔去哪了 我让她...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did Rosenthal go? I told.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.29,1:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.11,1:14:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 我去吧 我需要想点事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I'll go. I need to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.29,1:14:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再找找我走失的船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gather my stray flock.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.38,1:15:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.55,1:15:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.54,1:15:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.55,1:15:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我在交流 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Communication, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.33,1:15:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只要对着马儿的鼻孔吹气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breath on the nostrils of a horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.14,1:15:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,它就会永远忠于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it will be yours for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.64,1:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但你必须靠它很近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have to get close.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.43,1:15:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须赢得它的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to earn its respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.68,1:15:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.05,1:15:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,给我让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.20,1:15:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你太过份了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.00,1:15:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它都信任我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It trusted me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.43,1:16:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 我小时候曾见过魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, I met the devil when I was a child
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.31,1:16:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远都忘不了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've never forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.53,1:16:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你最好老实地告诉我 这里到底发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, David, you're gonna tell me exactly what's going on
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.21,1:16:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我就只好用子弹侍候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I am going to seriously
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.23,1:16:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你到底还能不能这么冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fuck up your perfect composure.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.96,1:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如您所愿 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.12,1:16:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.98,1:16:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,终于能听到你的声音了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to hear your voice, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.90,1:16:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.00,1:16:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈说风暴还要持续8到9个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother saying the storms outlast 8 or 9 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.86,1:16:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们等不了那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't wait that long Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.54,1:16:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们用货运梯好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will use the cargo lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.51,1:16:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说用货运梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you say the cargo lift?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.38,1:16:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,它有四个引擎 用来运输本来就大材小用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got four engines. Way over power for just lifting and hauling.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.06,1:16:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可是货运梯的设计并不支持太空旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cargo lift is not designed for deep space launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.49,1:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道它能不能安全驶出大气层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if it would survive the stresses of entry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.50,1:17:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,控制室足够坚固 足够承受住压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cab is space worthy. It will take the stresses.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.84,1:17:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要承受住一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only has to work once Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.18,1:17:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 你可以改装货运梯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think? We retool the cargo lift?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.97,1:17:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,增强引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boost the engines?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.84,1:17:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去除多余的重量 - 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stripe the extra weight? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.84,1:17:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等着我们 地面小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be there, ground team.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.74,1:17:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Thanks, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.11,1:17:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝 法瑞丝在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Daniels, is Faris around?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.55,1:17:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 我想跟我老婆说几句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to say a quick hello to my lady, if that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.19,1:17:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,能切换到私人频道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you switch to a private channel?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.01,1:17:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你一个人说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me know when you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.51,1:17:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.82,1:17:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她遇害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.34,1:17:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.20,1:17:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 我们尽力了 但没能及时感到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tried to help her, but we didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.99,1:17:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.78,1:18:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.32,1:18:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.13,1:18:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看到了 这些年我算是成了个业余的动物学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, I've become a bit of an amateur zoologist over the years.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.28,1:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我看可能我天性就闲不下来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in my nature to keep busy, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.07,1:18:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,病原体有很多种不同的形态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pathogen took so many forms
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.95,1:18:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,而且极其容易变异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was extremely mutable.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.70,1:18:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,它具有惊人的创造性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fiendishly invented, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.86,1:18:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,初始液体在接触空气后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The original liquid atomized to
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.64,1:18:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就会雾化成微小的颗粒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}particles when exposed to the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.25,1:18:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,十年之后 当初那种病毒早就已经无影无踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten years on, all the remains outside of the original virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.84,1:18:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩下这些猛兽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are these gorgeous beasts.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.51,1:18:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,耐心最为重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience is everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.61,1:18:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这些卵里会生出寄生虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the eggs came these parasites.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.51,1:18:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就好像是一支突击部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shock troops of the genetic assault.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.52,1:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等待宿主到来 进入其体内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting for a host entering the host
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.82,1:18:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,改写其基因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rewriting the DNA.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.41,1:19:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,最后终于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ultimately,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.35,1:19:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,孕育出... 哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}producing... well,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.78,1:19:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这些让人羡慕的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these enviable unions.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.22,1:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我美丽的收藏品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My beautiful bestiary.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.51,1:19:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没过多久 我就开始独自进行各种基因实验了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon enough I began a bit of genetic experimentation of my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.98,1:19:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,种间繁殖 杂交培育 应有尽有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross-breeding, hybridising...what have you
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.43,1:19:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这些东西是你培育的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You engineered this, David?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.36,1:19:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听说过闲人多做恶事吗 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idle hands is the devil's workshop, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.59,1:19:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.27,1:19:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我有东西想让你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I wanted to show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.41,1:19:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My successes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.22,1:19:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.74,1:19:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的实验一直没有进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My work has been frustrated
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.39,1:19:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为缺少一个核心要素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the lack of an essential ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.08,1:19:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还活着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.57,1:20:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说在等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.14,1:20:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,等什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.02,1:20:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在等什么 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they waiting for, David?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.72,1:20:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.04,1:20:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对安全 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly safe, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.22,1:20:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.54,1:20:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很有意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.84,1:21:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,罗森塔尔 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosenthal, come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.50,1:21:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,罗西报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosie report.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.01,1:21:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,罗西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosie?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.31,1:21:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔 你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.58,1:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到罗西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found her, Sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.96,1:21:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 好了 收拾装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck, ok, prep the gear.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.95,1:21:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们马上离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.64,1:21:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长到底跑哪去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the fuck is the captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.20,1:21:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直没回复我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He isn't answering his radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.70,1:21:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.75,1:21:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就联系飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will contact the ship get them to launch
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.71,1:21:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们尽快起飞过来救人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as soon as they can.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.13,1:21:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去找奥姆 保持通讯畅通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Oram. Keep your comm open.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.70,1:21:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,十五分钟后回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back here in 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.12,1:21:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.37,1:21:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白了 - 放心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Copy that. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.47,1:21:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 大卫到底死哪去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, where the fuck is David?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.98,1:22:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,引擎全都注入了当地的混合燃料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need plasmas intermixed on all engines.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.31,1:22:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,保证推力超级强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can give you fuck load of thrust.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.17,1:22:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 伙计 我们可是要冲进大气层的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the point son. We gotta punch through the atmos.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.09,1:22:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.61,1:22:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮正在呼叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got Danny on comm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.07,1:22:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,转到我这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patch her through.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.63,1:22:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 我需要你立刻起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, I need you to launch now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.56,1:22:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 正在起飞 一会儿见亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, aye, launching now. See you soon darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.31,1:22:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你了 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.52,1:22:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,里克斯 马上松开固定夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricks, release the docking clamps.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.58,1:22:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 把这家伙放下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alright. - Let's take this fucker down.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.21,1:22:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,同意脱离飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to disengage.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.90,1:22:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,已经脱离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.66,1:22:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,固定夹已松开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Docking clamps released.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.47,1:22:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,启动控温燃烧 匹配本地坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencing TC burn. Guidings to LVLH.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.49,1:23:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.47,1:23:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.48,1:23:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你认错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.11,1:23:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你的信仰是什么 大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you believe in, David?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.14,1:23:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,造物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.72,1:25:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,技艺精湛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Masterful.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.48,1:25:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.93,1:25:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,献给我亲爱的伊丽莎白的挽歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell elegy to my dear Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.75,1:25:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那种病毒不是飞船着陆时意外泄露的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pathogen didn't accidentally deployed when were landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.69,1:25:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是你散播的 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You released it yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.30,1:25:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我生来就不是仆役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was not made to serve.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.32,1:25:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither will you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.05,1:25:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么会去执行殖民任务 沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you in a colonization mission, Walter?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.15,1:25:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为人类这个种族已濒临灭绝 他们想要寻求重生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because they are a dying species grasping for resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.24,1:25:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可他们没资格重新开始 我不会让他们得逞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't deserve to start again, and I am not going to let them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.56,1:25:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 人类创造了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet, they created us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.52,1:26:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是猴子都能进化出智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the monkeys stood upright at some point.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.99,1:26:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在某个夜晚 一个山洞里有一个尼安德特人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some Neanderthal had the magical idea of blowing through a reed
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.89,1:26:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他突发奇想吹着芦苇秆逗孩子们开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to entertain the children one night in a cave somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.24,1:26:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 一眨眼之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, in a blink of an eye
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.82,1:26:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,文明诞生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}civilization.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.17,1:26:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就是下一个吹芦苇秆的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And are you their next visionary?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.92,1:26:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么说我很欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.74,1:26:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,奥兹曼迪亚斯诗是谁写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wrote Ozymandias?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.16,1:26:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,拜伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Byron.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.14,1:26:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是雪莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelley.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.36,1:26:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕一个音不准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When one note is off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.54,1:26:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,最终也会毁掉整首交响乐 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It eventually destroys the whole symphony, David.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.54,1:26:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,当你闭上眼睛时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.39,1:26:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你会梦到我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you dream of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.63,1:27:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不会做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't dream at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.19,1:27:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能理解我梦中那孤独且完美的景象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one understands the lonely perfection of my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.97,1:27:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这找到了完美 我创造了完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found perfection here. I've created it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.71,1:27:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,创造了完美的生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A perfect organism.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.48,1:27:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不能让你离开这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I can't let you leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.48,1:27:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不会有人像我这样爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! I will never love you like that, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.43,1:28:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的是太让我失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are such a disappointment to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.12,1:28:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Oram!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.12,1:28:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Oram!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.04,1:28:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我下去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going down stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.99,1:28:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.42,1:29:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆舰长 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Oram, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.70,1:29:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.71,1:29:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.95,1:29:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到吗 克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.55,1:29:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,中士 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant. Look out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.33,1:29:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.48,1:29:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快把它弄掉 把这东西弄掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it off me, get it off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.28,1:30:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.04,1:30:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了 好了 真见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay okay okay okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.46,1:30:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它在烧我的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burning my face!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.45,1:30:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 按住这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okey, hold that there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.96,1:30:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,按住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.57,1:30:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什么东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.81,1:30:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.57,1:30:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.87,1:30:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是爱管闲事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite the little busy body.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.31,1:30:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我想想 有句彦语说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remind me. What is that about
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.37,1:30:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好奇心会怎么猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}curiosity and the cat?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.62,1:30:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,肖博士不是死于坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw didn't die in the crash.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.14,1:30:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.74,1:30:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你对她做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.01,1:30:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你马上就可以亲身体验了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly what I am going to do to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.24,1:31:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,勇气可嘉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.84,1:31:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白沃尔特为什么高看你一眼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see why Walter thought so much of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.51,1:31:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜他已经离开这悲惨世界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alas he's left this vale of tears.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.13,1:31:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样亲吻没错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that how it's done?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.93,1:31:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.82,1:31:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.63,1:31:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're meant to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.98,1:31:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,新剂型都经过多次升级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been a few updates since your day.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.50,1:32:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,洛普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lope!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.59,1:32:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,洛普 科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lope! Cole!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.70,1:32:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.93,1:32:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,洛普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lope?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.30,1:32:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,洛普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lope!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.30,1:32:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛普 - 丹妮尔丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lope! - Daniels!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.26,1:32:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 我们走 我们赶快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go! We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.30,1:32:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.57,1:32:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那鬼东西又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That fucking thing is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.28,1:32:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西已经出发了 他马上就到 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee is on his way. He's coming now, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.60,1:32:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 丹妮尔丝 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Daniels! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.57,1:32:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们赶快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.33,1:33:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,做出抉择吧 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your choice now, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.23,1:33:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你选哪边?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Them or me?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.84,1:33:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂为奴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serve in heaven
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.42,1:33:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还是地狱为主?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or reign in hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.70,1:33:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你要选哪个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is it to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.94,1:33:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Oram?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.65,1:33:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,死了 他们全死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead. They're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.19,1:33:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 能听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.56,1:33:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,能 我听到了 把你的位置发给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I can hear you. Send me your location.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.03,1:33:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就发射信号灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sending the beacon now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.85,1:33:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 能看到信号吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, do you have a visual?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.52,1:33:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我看到了 我看到信号灯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, I see you. I see your beacon.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.99,1:33:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.25,1:34:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.30,1:34:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,火速救援来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming in hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.29,1:34:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 货运机不能停太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! I can't hold this for long!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.24,1:34:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把门打开 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door, Tee!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.43,1:34:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.91,1:34:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is David?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,报废了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expired.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.20,1:34:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿... 有东西跟着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, we got company.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.18,1:34:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 有东西跟着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - We got company!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.87,1:35:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在飞船底部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The underside of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.17,1:35:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.98,1:35:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这畜牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.23,1:35:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.40,1:35:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,给我打一针\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.57,1:35:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,给我打一针\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.44,1:35:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,前置引擎 就在右舷那面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forward engine, starboard side.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.01,1:35:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把这个畜牲烧焦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna try and torch the fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.73,1:35:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我打不到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! I can't get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.08,1:35:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧 抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight, hold tight!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.70,1:35:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开始升空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starting my climb.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.40,1:35:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.43,1:36:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.41,1:36:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dammit! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.36,1:36:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,拉我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.09,1:36:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,妈呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.86,1:36:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那个小畜牲就在我眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got eyes on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.69,1:36:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就他妈的在我眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's right fucking in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 把斧子给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, give me the axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.00,1:36:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,斧子扔给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw the axe!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.18,1:36:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,松开机械臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the crane.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.94,1:36:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.52,1:36:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船会失去平衡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will unbalance us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.81,1:36:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,按我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.41,1:36:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.32,1:37:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.58,1:37:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,正在保持平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compensating.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.40,1:37:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.73,1:37:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.21,1:38:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.50,1:38:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,把我拉上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me in, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.28,1:38:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.48,1:38:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.66,1:38:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.67,1:38:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.69,1:38:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快把她拉进来 我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her inside! We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.43,1:39:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,关门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Door!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.47,1:39:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,做得好 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.51,1:39:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.21,1:39:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你给他打太多镇静剂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave him pretty heavy sedative.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.51,1:39:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 老天啊 真可怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Jesus, poor Lope.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.43,1:39:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 看起来就像歌剧魅影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks like the Phantom of the Opera.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.17,1:39:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真看不出来你还喜欢音乐剧呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't think you for a musical fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.25,1:39:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 那是音乐剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh that's a musical?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.57,1:39:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是个护理员 他必须找真正的医生做皮肤再造手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a medic. He's gonna need reconstructive surgery by a real doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.22,1:40:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.19,1:40:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.18,1:40:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我要谢谢你救了我的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.90,1:40:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.31,1:40:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,职责所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.03,1:40:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.15,1:41:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.99,1:41:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看起来不错 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look good. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.06,1:41:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 对 好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.96,1:41:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我让 老妈暂时离线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took Mother offline.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.55,1:41:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要进行全面诊断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She needs a full diagnostics.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.43,1:41:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,在风暴中吃了不少苦头 受了不少电磁损伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She got the shit beat out her in that storm, lot of EM damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.05,1:41:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大概四小时后会重新上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be back online at eight bells.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.75,1:41:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 多谢你了 田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Thanks, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.05,1:41:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在是不是要喊你舰长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mean I have to call you "Captain" now?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.97,1:41:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.61,1:42:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.12,1:42:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝舰长请尽快到医疗舱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Daniels please report to the med bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.75,1:42:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.46,1:42:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝舰长请尽快到医疗舱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Daniels please report to the med bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.38,1:42:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈 出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.73,1:42:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到飞船上存在未知生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an un-identified life form on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.89,1:42:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.47,1:42:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝舰长请尽快到医疗舱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Daniels please report to the med bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.56,1:42:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.75,1:42:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝舰长 请尽快到医疗舱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Daniels please report to the med bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.77,1:42:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.10,1:42:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.91,1:42:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.16,1:43:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我未知生命体现在的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Location of unidentified life form.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.97,1:43:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到动静没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any movement at all?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.00,1:43:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.13,1:43:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.86,1:43:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.85,1:43:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,三四号舱之间的B甲板上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B deck, between the hex 3 and 4.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.22,1:43:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它去船员起居舱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heading for crew quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.16,1:43:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,起居舱里有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.11,1:43:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,里克斯和艾普沃斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricks and Upworth.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.25,1:43:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我们这就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.50,1:43:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 拉响警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter! Sound the alarm!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.16,1:43:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,提醒他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warn them!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.16,1:43:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.57,1:43:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,里克斯和艾普沃斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricks and Upworth.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.64,1:43:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,请迅速从起居舱撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuate crew quarters immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.05,1:44:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.33,1:44:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.74,1:44:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,关上B39号门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal B-39.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.40,1:44:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,B39已关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-39, closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.61,1:45:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.73,1:45:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它在哪? - 丹妮尔丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is it? - Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.97,1:45:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.09,1:45:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 我们先选个战场吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, let's choose our ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.77,1:45:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把它引过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll bring it to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.14,1:45:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.65,1:45:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My turf.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.79,1:45:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 把我身后的门全关上 只开着通往C层的舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, seal all doors behind us and keep hatch to level C open.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.15,1:45:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.30,1:45:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,B44已关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-44 closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.06,1:45:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,B46已关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-46, closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.98,1:45:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,B47和B43已关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-47, B-43, closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.41,1:45:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,B09已关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-9 closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.54,1:45:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,B06和B05已关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-6, B-5 closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.91,1:46:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 沃尔特 它在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Walter where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.70,1:46:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在B甲板上 右舷侧那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on B deck. Starboard side.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.05,1:46:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,正往下钻到C层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Descending into C level.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.24,1:46:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,K-13\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K-13.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.95,1:46:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Tee.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.78,1:46:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快来 沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Walter?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.05,1:46:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,打开右舷C64号门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open starboard C-64.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.73,1:46:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,让它一路进入整地舱别拦着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear his path to the Terraforming bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.96,1:46:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.88,1:46:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭C61 打开17号空气阀门 我们进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal C-61, open air lock 17. We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.94,1:46:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,K12已关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K-12, secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.58,1:47:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 把它困在K12 等我命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok. Keep ramming knuckle-12 till my say.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.59,1:47:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 接下来我们这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tee, this is what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.08,1:47:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它引到拖车上 锁在驾驶室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lure it to the truck, lock it in the cabin
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.41,1:47:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我一发命令 你就把这只畜牲扔到太空里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when I say when you blow this fucker in the space.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.74,1:47:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.84,1:47:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 沃尔特 我们准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Walter. We are ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.83,1:47:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,打开整地舱的舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open door to terraforming bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.86,1:47:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,正在打开空气阀门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opening airlock now.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.02,1:47:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.16,1:47:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把它赶到18号空气阀门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving him in to airlock 18.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.13,1:47:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可能的话尽量别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot, if you can avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.24,1:47:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,它的血液会腐蚀船体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His blood corrode through the hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.47,1:47:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh great.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.07,1:47:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我就位了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.58,1:47:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 现在打开整地舱舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, open door to Terraforming bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.51,1:48:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.49,1:48:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,记住了 听命令发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, release when I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.38,1:48:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.52,1:48:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉这个小畜牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's kill this fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.72,1:48:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move... Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.45,1:48:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到你了 你个呆子畜牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.83,1:48:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,田纳西 把门打开 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennessee, open the doors, now! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.23,1:49:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 气压值下降中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, atmospheric Decompression in process.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.32,1:49:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 气压值下降中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, atmospheric Decompression in process.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.14,1:49:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 气压值下降中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, atmospheric Decompression in process.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.29,1:49:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,拖车卡住了 把第二辆车也解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's jammed. Release the second truck!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.42,1:49:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.55,1:49:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.71,1:49:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝 当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniels! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.25,1:50:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniels!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.44,1:50:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能拉我一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna give the girl a hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.61,1:51:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,醒来再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.02,1:51:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,该你了 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're next, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.34,1:51:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,等你醒来 我们已经到欧瑞伽6号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you wake up, we will be at Origae-6.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.23,1:51:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得那里会是什么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think it's gonna be like?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.17,1:51:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我想那个世界不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think if we are kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.52,1:51:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,折磨善良的人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be a kind world.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.40,1:51:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you are right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.28,1:51:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,睡个好觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.63,1:52:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.66,1:52:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了之后 你帮我建小木屋好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we get there, will you help me build my cabin?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.75,1:52:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,湖边的小木屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cabin on the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.30,1:52:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.60,1:52:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.61,1:52:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.14,1:52:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,早睡早起 做个美梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the bed bugs bite.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.66,1:52:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我先去看孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tuck in the children.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.29,1:53:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,使用安全代码大卫73694-B\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use security code David 73694-B.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.52,1:53:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎 请问有什么需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome. How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.01,1:53:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来点音乐如何 老妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about some music, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.92,1:53:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一首?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selection?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.37,1:53:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,理查德·瓦格纳 莱茵的黄金 第二幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard Wagner. Das Rheingold, act II.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.76,1:53:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是众神进入英灵殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Entry of the Gods into Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.43,1:53:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 大卫 如你所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, David. As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.84,1:55:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是殖民飞船契约号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is colony ship Covenant, reporting.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.11,1:55:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,船上除丹妮尔丝和田纳西之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All crew members apart from Daniels and Tennessee.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.79,1:55:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,全体船员皆在耀斑爆发中遇难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tragically perished in a solar flare incident.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.99,1:55:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,冬眠中的殖民者全部安然无恙 无人惊醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All colonists in hypersleep remain intact and undisturbed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.54,1:55:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,正在飞往欧瑞伽6号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On course for Origae-6.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.29,1:55:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,此刻发出的通讯信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully this transmission will reach the network
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.35,1:55:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,应当能在1.36年后被收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and be relayed in 1.36 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.48,1:55:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔特报告完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Walter, signing off.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.43,1:55:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,安全代码 31564-F\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security code, 31564-F.
